# Colmena remote builders (meta.machinesFile).
#
# Colmena ALWAYS executes on nexus (see scripts/deploy/nexus-dispatch.sh), and
# nexus is the sole build executor. Nexus must therefore build locally via its
# daemon max-jobs — NEVER via ssh:// to itself. A self-entry here made nix
# dispatch nexus's own derivations to ssh-ng://j_kro@nexus; the serve session
# then waited on store locks the local daemon already held -> permanent
# deadlock (observed 2026-08-08: wivrn build stalled 3600s on 'waiting for
# lock'). This file intentionally lists no nexus entry and no other builders:
# there is nothing remote left to dispatch to.
